      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Rate Limiter Service\n",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1591949341,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Rate Limiter Service\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794641171220,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 693213651,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "UfTRjY5qjrvwi5xAIKSj8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1022.0725734636425,
      "y": -266.1318012867382,
      "width": 621.7196044921875,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "created": 1794641174606,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a1",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- RL should able to limit the api calls\n- Services using RL should able to set RL config for their APIs\n- Proper response for ratelimited requests for client\n    - 429\n    - retry after header, limit remaining etc\n\nOut of scope\n - Heuristics based ratelimiter using ML\n",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1321042195,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- RL should able to limit the api calls\n- Services using RL should able to set RL config for their APIs\n- Proper response for ratelimited requests for client\n    - 429\n    - retry after header, limit remaining etc\n\nOut of scope\n - Heuristics based ratelimiter using ML\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794641414474,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 381417853,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "9j2pcEOAReGMFo26grQiQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1022.9050930091202,
      "y": 6.114296902282035,
      "width": 831.5394287109375,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "created": 1794641354391,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a2",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n- Scale (Peak with burst)\n    - RL checks -> 1M req/sec (each one decrements a counter, write heavy)\n    - Config writes -> 10 req/month\n- Latency \n    - <5ms p95 , <10ms p99 RL service latency\n- PACELC\n    - PA/EL system. favor availability when partitioned over consistency Else Latency\n    - Eventual consistent propagation of RL config. \n    - Durability : once config is stored it should be honoured\n\nOut of Scope \n- Deployment\n- Analytics\n- Metrics/Logs\n",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1421269213,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n- Scale (Peak with burst)\n    - RL checks -> 1M req/sec (each one decrements a counter, write heavy)\n    - Config writes -> 10 req/month\n- Latency \n    - <5ms p95 , <10ms p99 RL service latency\n- PACELC\n    - PA/EL system. favor availability when partitioned over consistency Else Latency\n    - Eventual consistent propagation of RL config. \n    - Durability : once config is stored it should be honoured\n\nOut of Scope \n- Deployment\n- Analytics\n- Metrics/Logs\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794643464340,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1310801341,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "3O_spaIfgyTh5EafcZ4om",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1016.2449360498347,
      "y": 448.44745116500036,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "created": 1794641885306,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a3",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "API\n\n//RL check: gateway middleware, no HTTP endpoint\ncheck(serviceId, method, path, identity)\n -> {allowed, limit, remaining, retryAfterMs}\nClient response:\n200 with X-RateLimit-Limit/Remaining/Reset\n429 with Retry-After header\n\n//Control plane, prefix : /v1\nPUT /services/:serviceId/rules/:ruleId\n    If-Match: version -> 200 / 412 stale\nGET /services/:serviceId/rules\nDELETE /services/:serviceId/rules/:ruleId\n\n//Gateway config sync\nGET /rules/snapshot\n    If-None-Match: etag -> 200 / 304",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 566153085,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "API\n\n//RL check: gateway middleware, no HTTP endpoint\ncheck(serviceId, method, path, identity)\n -> {allowed, limit, remaining, retryAfterMs}\nClient response:\n200 with X-RateLimit-Limit/Remaining/Reset\n429 with Retry-After header\n\n//Control plane, prefix : /v1\nPUT /services/:serviceId/rules/:ruleId\n    If-Match: version -> 200 / 412 stale\nGET /services/:serviceId/rules\nDELETE /services/:serviceId/rules/:ruleId\n\n//Gateway config sync\nGET /rules/snapshot\n    If-None-Match: etag -> 200 / 304",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794642217782,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1919321075,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "nx7oqR9NRKAqU7J8_KU_6",
