    {
      "id": "rvw1ImprovementsBlock01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1052.8758029979351,
      "y": 2215,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "created": 1794645000000,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "an",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Open decisions\n- Accuracy: state acceptable overshoot (drives the leasing batch size)\n- Capacity: active keys x ~100 bytes -> Redis memory + shard count\n- Redis failover: losing recent counters on failover is acceptable\n- Multi-region: limits per region or global?\n- IP identity: handle NAT (many users behind one IP) and X-Forwarded-For spoofing",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 482913077,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Open decisions\n- Accuracy: state acceptable overshoot (drives the leasing batch size)\n- Capacity: active keys x ~100 bytes -> Redis memory + shard count\n- Redis failover: losing recent counters on failover is acceptable\n- Multi-region: limits per region or global?\n- IP identity: handle NAT (many users behind one IP) and X-Forwarded-For spoofing",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794645000000,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 913420655,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
